mage":"plonkit/albania/Rifts.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/P8qjpZRz5JsZGEFn8","clues":["coverage","rifts"],"important":false,"tagged":true,"country":"albania","country_name":"Albania"},{"id":"gh0p","text":["‘**Rifts**’ can uncommonly be seen in Montenegrin generation 3 coverage, due to poor stitching.","NOTE: Rifts are also common in Albania, and can rarely be seen in various other countries."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/montenegro/Rifts.webp","link":"https://goo.gl/maps/o1wjizUD3kztzsDx8","clues":["coverage","rifts"],"important":false,"tagged":true,"country":"montenegro","country_name":"Montenegro"},{"id":"T5Vc","text":["Iceland is a very **geologically active** country, where plate tectonics and volcanic processes have shaped the landscape. As a result, many regions are rugged, mountainous and a sight to behold. In addition, strange and bewildering landscapes can be found all over, such as geothermal lakes, lava fields, rift valleys, and towering rock formations."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/iceland/Iceland_Volcanic.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ejfXoukw1Z771E8u7","clues":["rifts","scenery"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"iceland","country_name":"Iceland"},{"id":"akFr","text":["Generation 4 coverage in **eastern Mongolia** uses a silver pick-up truck with a large **metal box **and shovel on the roof. The car was sponsored by Bodi Group, however camera stitching generally hides one of the letters."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/mongolia/eastgen4car_v2.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/KvsWK5bp6S2JJzYs6","clues":["rifts","architecture","language"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"mongolia","country_name":"Mongolia"},{"id":"Oefv","text":["The tent with 2 straps and a **single knot** in the straps covers most of northwestern Mongolia.","NOTE: Occasionally, camera stitching can [hide the knot](https://maps.app.goo.gl/pFWZ5yX4uJE56xoA9)."],"text_zh":[],"image":"plonkit/mongolia/M20IPWi.webp","link":"https://maps.app.goo.gl/odAqTQcdMap9hJYYA","clues":["rifts"],"important":false,"tagged":false,"country":"mongolia","country_name":"Mongolia"}],"gallery_count":145,"tip_count":5}